<title>BELGIUM: Boeing says no deal yet over Delta purchase.</title>
<headline>Boeing says no deal yet over Delta purchase.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co said on Tuesday it was still in talks with Delta Air Lines Inc over the airline's aircraft purchasing plans, but competition was tough.</p>
<p>&quot;We are in a very strong competition at Delta,&quot; Boeing chairman and CEO Phil Condit told a meeting organised by the European Aviation Club.</p>
<p>He added: &quot;We have not reached any agreement at this point.&quot;</p>
<p>Europe's Airbus Industrie consortium and Boeing are competing to replace Delta's aging fleet of L-1011 aircraft. -- Brussels newsroom 322 2876841</p>
</text>
